					"description": "Run one bounded pass of the soft-delete purge lane (orgs and person accounts past the 30-day restore window, plus legacy account deletions left with deleting_at set and deleted_at null, which have no restore window). dryRun defaults to true and lists candidates without hard deletes. Set dryRun false to execute writes (respects SOFT_DELETE_PURGE_ENABLED on the worker unless dryRun is explicitly false). Admin-only and destructive.",
