					"name": "adminCredentialStampMigrate",
					"domain": "admin",
					"description": "Platform-side credential-stamp migration for issue #3836: fleet dry-run/apply of 0015-convert-credential-stamps (declare allowlisted missing bare deps such as remix, seal inferred kody.credentials). Does not strip |scope= placeholders. Skips Kent holdouts and packages that cannot be proven conversion-ready. No owner contact. Does not enable phase 3 runtime fail-closed. One page per execute/sandbox. Resume with the returned runId and nextCursor until null. dryRun default is true (transform + publish checks only); set dryRun false to republish converted trees. Codemod 0015-convert-credential-stamps skips Kent holdouts (`@kentcdodds/raycast`, `@kentcdodds/oauth-integration-health`) and anything still unconvertible; it never emails or notifies package owners, never creates credential values, and preserves job/trigger enablements via the existing republish path. After apply pages complete, run adminCredentialStampBackfill dryRun→false to stamp seal-ready packages. Paged: one page per execute or workflow sandbox (default limit 5). When nextCursor is set, start a new execute or workflows.create with that runId and cursor — do not loop pages in the same sandbox.",
