					"name": "adminDeadLetterQueuePeek",
					"domain": "admin",
					"description": "Peek at messages parked from one production dead-letter queue, oldest first, as redacted metadata only: message id, attempts, timestamps, source queue, kind/type, payload size, top-level key names, and stable ids such as feedbackId. Never returns message bodies, user content, tokens, or secrets. Admin-only.",
