					"name": "executionContextUpdate",
					"domain": "executionContexts",
					"description": "Rename an execution context or change its grant (files, egress, Kody API runtime allowlist, limits), or turn host commands off (`grant.commands.enabled: false`; turning them on happens only on the machine). Every run on a context uses its requester's credentials exactly as in Kody cloud (requests leave from Kody cloud, so values never reach the machine). Needs Contribute or Manage on it.",
