					"description": "Replace your execution chain. Send every entry in order ({kind:\"context\",id} or {kind:\"cloud\"}) and ifMatch set to the updatedAt you read (null for a chain never changed). Kody cloud, when present, must be the last entry (it is always available, so nothing after it would run); anything else is a 400. Leaving out cloud makes the chain strict: runs fail instead of falling back. 409 chain_changed returns the current chain.",
