			"name": "profiles",
			"description": "Profiles (an experiment: turn it on with experimentSet or at /account/experiments): scoped identities in an org for the agents and bots you run, with a snapshot of grants, an optional expiry that only shortens, sub-profiles up to 5 levels, and a final revoke that stops everything below. To let an agent act as a profile, mint a profile token through the api tool: tokenCreate with profile_id, or profileHandoff for a new sub-profile plus its token (profile tokens are not accepted by /mcp). Guide: guide:profiles.",
