								"additionalProperties": false,
								"description": "The new commit is built but not live. This internet-visible app now asks for more capabilities than the approved version, so everyone, members and the owner included, stays on serving_commit until the owner approves at approval_url. Approving moves everyone to held_commit. Test the new version with local dev or a dev check. Different from locked and approval_required, which pause a publish before it starts."
