					"domain": "runs",
					"description": "Summarize recent run totals, open error count (excluding ignored/resolved), ignored/resolved counts, still-running count, and per-surface breakdown to answer \"is anything broken?\" before drilling into runList or runGet. Use runUpdate to mark handled error noise. Counts include successful ad-hoc execute runs. Records are retained about 30 days, capped per user, and pruned failure-last.",
